    {"id": "PLATFORM-571882233010-012", "title": "Sankalp Dandawate , Palak Khanna , Amol Gawande , et al. Augmented Reality in Fa", "content": "Sankalp Dandawate , Palak Khanna , Amol Gawande , et al. Augmented Reality in Fashion Retail: Enhancing Co …\nGraph 1\nAR applications usage\nOwn elaboration.\nTable 3 and Graph 1 exemplify the frequency analysis of scaling the usage of AR applications. Almost 72% \nof consumers in the fashion sector found it easy to utilise AR applications. 7.5% of them found the application \nvery easy to use. On the contrary, 6% of them found it difficult, and 3.5% of them found it very difficult to use \nthe AR application to evaluate the fit and style of the products in the fashion sector. The findings address \n", "source": "platform/571882233010.pdf", "dimension": "platform", "tags": []},
