    {"id": "PLATFORM-571882233010-015", "title": "Mercados y Negocios , , 2025 , vol. 26, núm. 56, September-December , ISSN: 1665", "content": "Mercados y Negocios , , 2025 , vol. 26, núm. 56, September-December , ISSN: 1665-7039  / ISSN-E: 2594-0163\nContemporary research (Erdmann et al., 2023 ) evaluates consumers\' purchasing intentions to adopt AR. \nData were gathered from 253 participants, and a cost- benefit process was conducted. The outcome suggests \nthat experiential AR has a positive impact on consumers\' purchasing intentions on online platforms. Similarly, \nthe present study examines the impact of perceived benefits on purchasing intention. In the ANOVA test, the \np-values are less than 0.05, indicating a substantial correlat", "source": "platform/571882233010.pdf", "dimension": "platform", "tags": []},
