    {"id": "PLATFORM-商业生态系统视角下出口型跨境电商企业的海-035", "title": "main  forms  of logistics:  domestic  express  mode,  postal parcel  mode,  spec", "content": "main  forms  of logistics:  domestic  express  mode,  postal parcel  mode,  special  line logistics mode, international express mode, and overseas warehousing mode. As one of  the   recently  emerged  cross-border  e-commerce   logistics   mode  of  overseas warehousing mode, compared with the traditional logistics mode, in the transport time is  more rapid, and at the same time can be  more timely  for consumers to provide goods return service. Comprehensive factors, it is not difficult to find the advantages and disadvantages of the logistics model at this stage, in the development of cross-", "source": "platform/商业生态系统视角下出口型跨境电商企业的海外战略分析_孙智佳.docx", "dimension": "platform", "tags": []},
    {"id": "PLATFORM-商业生态系统视角下出口型跨境电商企业的海-036", "title": "Third,   the    scale   of   personalised    customisation.    Consumers\'   purs", "content": "Third,   the    scale   of   personalised    customisation.    Consumers\'   pursuit    of personalisation  and   quality  of  consumption  psychology   has   led  to  the  gradual formation of the  corresponding  scale  of personalised  customisation,  for  example, clothing, beauty, household products, and so on. At this stage, some cross-border e- commerce   enterprises    have   already    standardised   the    production   of   internal components of their products to  meet the demands of consumers  with the  help  of different forms of combinations. In the future, along with the 3D printi", "source": "platform/商业生态系统视角下出口型跨境电商企业的海外战略分析_孙智佳.docx", "dimension": "platform", "tags": []},
    {"id": "PLATFORM-商业生态系统视角下出口型跨境电商企业的海-037", "title": "technology,  the  cost  of personalised  customisation  by  merchants  will  con", "content": "technology,  the  cost  of personalised  customisation  by  merchants  will  continue  to reduce,  and  consumers  can  also  spend   less   to  complete  their  own  personalised customisation  requirements.", "source": "platform/商业生态系统视角下出口型跨境电商企业的海外战略分析_孙智佳.docx", "dimension": "platform", "tags": []},
    {"id": "PLATFORM-商业生态系统视角下出口型跨境电商企业的海-038", "title": "With the development of the times and the continuous improvement of Internet tec", "content": "With the development of the times and the continuous improvement of Internet technology, e-commerce has been developed accordingly in many countries around the world, and at the same time, cross-border business and trade activities have been greatly driven. The development of cross-border e-commerce  in China  has its own characteristics, and the whole shows a vigorous vitality, which has a positive impact on the development of China\'s  economy and people\'s  life.  In the  future,  with the deepening  of  the   globalisation  process  and  the  continuous  improvement  of  the technology  leve", "source": "platform/商业生态系统视角下出口型跨境电商企业的海外战略分析_孙智佳.docx", "dimension": "platform", "tags": []},
    {"id": "PLATFORM-商业生态系统视角下出口型跨境电商企业的海-039", "title": "Although the whole industry shows a trend of rapid growth, the competition in th", "content": "Although the whole industry shows a trend of rapid growth, the competition in the E-commerce industry  is pretty cruel.  How can TEMU stands out from the crowd?\n\nThough shown a trend of rapid growth, the trade tensions between China and the United  States cannot be  ignored. What are  the  new risks  and challenges  faced by TEMU?\n\nFrom the perspective of Business Ecosystem Theory,  how can TEMU devises possible  strategies  to deal with  new risks  and  challenges?", "source": "platform/商业生态系统视角下出口型跨境电商企业的海外战略分析_孙智佳.docx", "dimension": "platform", "tags": []},
    {"id": "PLATFORM-商业生态系统视角下出口型跨境电商企业的海-040", "title": "On the one hand, the proposed research holds significant theoretical implication", "content": "On the one hand, the proposed research holds significant theoretical implications within  the  domain  of  cross-border  e-commerce  studies.  By  employing  a   value structure perspective  and  Business  Ecosystem  Theory,  this  paper  delves   into  the intricate   dynamics   of   cross-border    e-commerce    enterprises.    This   theoretical\n\nframework offers a nuanced  understanding of how enterprises navigate competitive landscapes,  sustain  advantages,   and   foster   ecosystem  interactions.  Through  the analysis  of value  propositions  and  manifestations  within  business  eco", "source": "platform/商业生态系统视角下出口型跨境电商企业的海外战略分析_孙智佳.docx", "dimension": "platform", "tags": []},
    {"id": "PLATFORM-商业生态系统视角下出口型跨境电商企业的海-041", "title": "Furthermore, the integration of synergism theory and evolutionary game theory en", "content": "Furthermore, the integration of synergism theory and evolutionary game theory enhances the theoretical depth of the study. These theoretical lenses provide analytical tools  to  explore   the  complex   interactions   among  stakeholders,   the  evolution  of competitive  populations,   and   the   dynamics   of  profit   models   and    ecological sustainability within cross-border e-commerce ecosystems. By synthesising insights from diverse theoretical perspectives, the research advances our understanding of the multifaceted challenges and opportunities facing cross-border e-commerce enterpr", "source": "platform/商业生态系统视角下出口型跨境电商企业的海外战略分析_孙智佳.docx", "dimension": "platform", "tags": []},
    {"id": "PLATFORM-商业生态系统视角下出口型跨境电商企业的海-042", "title": "The practical significance of this research lies in its potential to offer actio", "content": "The practical significance of this research lies in its potential to offer actionable insights   for   the   sustainable   development   of  China\'s   cross-border   e-commerce enterprises. Through in-depth case studies and analysis, the research aims to provide practical recommendations  tailored  to  the  specific  needs  and  contexts  of export- oriented  cross-border  e-commerce  enterprises.  These  recommendations  encompass expanding   ecosystem   boundaries,   optimising   intra-ecosystem   competition,   and enhancing enterprise value propositions and ecological environments. By leve", "source": "platform/商业生态系统视角下出口型跨境电商企业的海外战略分析_孙智佳.docx", "dimension": "platform", "tags": []},
    {"id": "PLATFORM-商业生态系统视角下出口型跨境电商企业的海-043", "title": "1.3 Research purpose  and methodology", "content": "1.3 Research purpose  and methodology\n\nThe proposed research aims  to  investigate  strategies  for  TEMU,  a  leading  e- commerce platform, to differentiate itself and stand out in the highly competitive e- commerce   industry,   while   also   identifying   and   addressing  the  new  risks   and challenges  arising  from  the  trade  tensions  between  China  and  the  United  States. Drawing on the Business Ecosystem Theory, the study will explore potential strategic approaches  TEMU  can utilize to  navigate  the evolving  competitive  landscape  and mitigate the impact of the geopolitic", "source": "platform/商业生态系统视角下出口型跨境电商企业的海外战略分析_孙智佳.docx", "dimension": "platform", "tags": []},
    {"id": "PLATFORM-商业生态系统视角下出口型跨境电商企业的海-044", "title": "Firstly, the e-commerce industry has experienced a period of rapid  growth, with", "content": "Firstly, the e-commerce industry has experienced a period of rapid  growth, with consumers increasingly shifting their purchasing behaviors toward online platforms. This  trend  has  led  to  a  highly  competitive  market, where  e-commerce players are vying for market share and customer loyalty.  TEMU, as a prominent player  in this dynamic environment,  faces the  challenge of differentiating  itself and  standing out from the crowd.  Understanding the  factors that contribute to  TEMU\'s  competitive advantage and the strategies it can employ to enhance its unique positioning is crucial for", "source": "platform/商业生态系统视角下出口型跨境电商企业的海外战略分析_孙智佳.docx", "dimension": "platform", "tags": []},
    {"id": "PLATFORM-商业生态系统视角下出口型跨境电商企业的海-045", "title": "Secondly, alongside the competitive dynamics within the e-commerce industry, the", "content": "Secondly, alongside the competitive dynamics within the e-commerce industry, the research will also examine the impact of the trade tensions between China and the United  States  on  TEMU\'s  operations  and  growth  prospects.  The  escalating  trade disputes between  the  two  economic  superpowers  have  introduced  a new  layer  of", "source": "platform/商业生态系统视角下出口型跨境电商企业的海外战略分析_孙智佳.docx", "dimension": "platform", "tags": []},
    {"id": "PLATFORM-商业生态系统视角下出口型跨境电商企业的海-046", "title": "uncertainty and risk  for businesses  operating in the  global market.  This pap", "content": "uncertainty and risk  for businesses  operating in the  global market.  This paper will investigate the specific challenges and risks faced by TEMU as a Chinese-based e- commerce company navigating the turbulent trade landscape. This may include, but is not limited to, the potential tariffs, regulatory changes, supply chain disruptions, and shifts in consumer behavior that TEMU may encounter. By analyzing the impact of these   geopolitical   factors    on   TEMU\'s    operations,   the   study   will   provide    a comprehensive  understanding  of the  new  risks  and  challenges  the  company ", "source": "platform/商业生态系统视角下出口型跨境电商企业的海外战略分析_孙智佳.docx", "dimension": "platform", "tags": []},
    {"id": "PLATFORM-商业生态系统视角下出口型跨境电商企业的海-047", "title": "Thirdly, the Business Ecosystem Theory provides a valuable lens through which to", "content": "Thirdly, the Business Ecosystem Theory provides a valuable lens through which to analyze TEMU\'s position and the strategies it can employ to navigate the evolving competitive landscape and the trade tensions. The research will explore how TEMU can  leverage  its  position  within  the  broader  e-commerce  ecosystem,  including  its relationships with suppliers, partners, competitors, and even regulators, to enhance its resilience  and adaptability.", "source": "platform/商业生态系统视角下出口型跨境电商企业的海外战略分析_孙智佳.docx", "dimension": "platform", "tags": []},
    {"id": "PLATFORM-商业生态系统视角下出口型跨境电商企业的海-048", "title": "In order to analyze a series of data in the process of strategic selection of TE", "content": "In order to analyze a series of data in the process of strategic selection of TEMU, which is a question that has not been covered or answered by existing literature, the method  of  case  study  is  adopted.  By  examining   how   Temu  occupies   its  niche, differentiates its strategy, interacts competitively, and coexists with its competitors, it is  possible  to   gain  a  better  understanding  of  its  competitive  dynamics,   market positioning,  and coexistence  strategies  within  the  e-commerce market.\n\nChapter 2 Literature Review and Theoretical Framework", "source": "platform/商业生态系统视角下出口型跨境电商企业的海外战略分析_孙智佳.docx", "dimension": "platform", "tags": []},
    {"id": "PLATFORM-商业生态系统视角下出口型跨境电商企业的海-049", "title": "Numerous scholars at home and abroad have orientated their research in the field", "content": "Numerous scholars at home and abroad have orientated their research in the field of business towards the study of competition in enterprises by applying the ecological niche theory, inspired by the biological ecological niche field. The pioneering work of ecological  theory is organisational  ecologist", "source": "platform/商业生态系统视角下出口型跨境电商企业的海外战略分析_孙智佳.docx", "dimension": "platform", "tags": []},
    {"id": "PLATFORM-商业生态系统视角下出口型跨境电商企业的海-050", "title": "Hannan  M.T  and  John  Freeman\'s  paper  \'Organisational  Population  Ecology\' ", "content": "Hannan  M.T  and  John  Freeman\'s  paper  \'Organisational  Population  Ecology\' ecological niche This paper applies the concept of biological ecological niches and research findings and methods to the study of business. The population ecology model focuses  on the  creation,  development  and  decline  of a  business  or  organisational community,  extending  ecological  theory  to  non-living  areas  and  emphasising  the integration of the organisational community with the external business environment in which it operates. Since then, the study of business ecosystems has begun to emerge, an", "source": "platform/商业生态系统视角下出口型跨境电商企业的海外战略分析_孙智佳.docx", "dimension": "platform", "tags": []},
