    {"id": "PLATFORM-商业生态系统视角下出口型跨境电商企业的海-105", "title": "Second, the development and intelligence of the logistics model. The cost and ef", "content": "Second, the development and intelligence of the logistics model. The cost and efficiency of logistics is one of the important factors that directly affect the shopping experience of consumers  in cross-border  e-commerce. At this stage,  there are  five main  forms  of logistics:  domestic  express  mode,  postal parcel  mode,  special  line logistics mode, international express mode, and overseas warehousing mode. As one of  the   recently  emerged  cross-border  e-commerce   logistics   mode  of  overseas warehousing mode, compared with the traditional logistics mode, in the transport time i", "source": "platform/商业生态系统视角下出口型跨境电商企业的海外战略分析_孙智佳.docx", "dimension": "platform", "tags": []},
    {"id": "PLATFORM-商业生态系统视角下出口型跨境电商企业的海-106", "title": "Third,   the    scale   of   personalised    customisation.    Consumers\'   purs", "content": "Third,   the    scale   of   personalised    customisation.    Consumers\'   pursuit    of personalisation  and   quality  of  consumption  psychology   has   led  to  the  gradual", "source": "platform/商业生态系统视角下出口型跨境电商企业的海外战略分析_孙智佳.docx", "dimension": "platform", "tags": []},
    {"id": "PLATFORM-商业生态系统视角下出口型跨境电商企业的海-107", "title": "formation of the  corresponding  scale  of personalised  customisation,  for  ex", "content": "formation of the  corresponding  scale  of personalised  customisation,  for  example, clothing, beauty, household products, and so on. At this stage, some cross-border e- commerce   enterprises    have   already    standardised   the    production   of   internal components of their products to  meet the demands of consumers  with the  help of different forms of combinations. In the future, along with the 3D printing technology, artificial   intelligence   level   and   the   continuous    improvement   of   virtualisation technology,  the  cost  of personalised  customisation  by  merchants ", "source": "platform/商业生态系统视角下出口型跨境电商企业的海外战略分析_孙智佳.docx", "dimension": "platform", "tags": []},
    {"id": "PLATFORM-商业生态系统视角下出口型跨境电商企业的海-108", "title": "With the development of the times and the continuous improvement of Internet tec", "content": "With the development of the times and the continuous improvement of Internet technology, e-commerce has been developed accordingly in many countries around the world, and at the same time, cross-border business and trade activities have been greatly driven. The development of cross-border e-commerce  in China  has its own characteristics, and the whole shows a vigorous vitality, which has a positive impact on the development of China\'s  economy and people\'s  life.  In the  future,  with the deepening  of  the   globalisation  process  and  the   continuous  improvement  of  the technology  lev", "source": "platform/商业生态系统视角下出口型跨境电商企业的海外战略分析_孙智佳.docx", "dimension": "platform", "tags": []},
    {"id": "PLATFORM-商业生态系统视角下出口型跨境电商企业的海-109", "title": "Temu   is   a   professional   cross-border   e-commerce   platform   launched  ", "content": "Temu   is   a   professional   cross-border   e-commerce   platform   launched   by Pinduoduo, which means \"Team Up, Price Down\", i.e. the more people buy, the lower the price. In China, Pinduoduo has achieved rapid growth in the industry by virtue of its solid price-performance advantage, but  Temu has  not been overwhelmed  in the overseas market, and has also achieved success in cross-border e-commerce by virtue of its  low-pricing  strategy. Temu\'s revenue will be US$290  million  in 2022,  and  is expected to reach US$14 billion in 2023, and US$30 billion in 2024, which is a leap forward ", "source": "platform/商业生态系统视角下出口型跨境电商企业的海外战略分析_孙智佳.docx", "dimension": "platform", "tags": []},
    {"id": "PLATFORM-商业生态系统视角下出口型跨境电商企业的海-110", "title": "description, service and logistics based on the consumer\'s evaluation, and other", "content": "description, service and logistics based on the consumer\'s evaluation, and other users\n\ncan use this evaluation to make a preliminary judgement on the goods provided by the\n\nmerchant in order to decide whether or not to buy the goods. there are information\n\nasymmetries on the Temu platform platform, such as the quality of the goods. Temu\n\nPlatform, as a platform-based cross-border e-commerce trading platform, its main role\n\nis  to   provide  a  platform   for   cross-border  transactions   between  merchants   and\n\nconsumers and to provide an entry point for traffic. Although there are a large", "source": "platform/商业生态系统视角下出口型跨境电商企业的海外战略分析_孙智佳.docx", "dimension": "platform", "tags": []},
    {"id": "PLATFORM-商业生态系统视角下出口型跨境电商企业的海-111", "title": "purchases, which may affect their shopping experience,  and Temu\'s innovative \"f", "content": "purchases, which may affect their shopping experience,  and Temu\'s innovative \"fully\n\nmanaged model\" is often cited as the decisive factor in the platform\'s ability to stand\n\nout in a short period of time. The fully managed model means that, unlike the usual e-\n\ncommerce platforms,  merchants on  Temu only need  to take  orders  for production,\n\nsend the goods to Pinduoduo\'s warehouse in Guangdong, and then do not need to be\n\ninvolved in all the subsequent processes. This  greatly reduces the cost and risk  for\n\nmerchants. Taking the  U.S.  market as a  starting point, we can rapidly expand th", "source": "platform/商业生态系统视角下出口型跨境电商企业的海外战略分析_孙智佳.docx", "dimension": "platform", "tags": []},
