    {"id": "PLATFORM-商业生态系统视角下出口型跨境电商企业的海-113", "title": "stationed  in  49  countries  and   has  covered  Asia,   Europe,  North  Americ", "content": "stationed  in  49  countries  and   has  covered  Asia,   Europe,  North  America,   South America,  Oceania  and South Africa.\n\nFigure  3-2 Poundland\'s  Fourth Quarter and Full  Year 2023 Earnings  Report6\n\nTemu\'s platform advantage has core resources such as team, capital, supply chain, etc., which help Temu quickly establish a competitive advantage.In terms of the team, Temu team has a strong fighting force. Former Pinduoduo COO Guo Pingping under the  leadership  of a wealth of experience and passion for work.  In addition,  Temu actively recruit members with rich experience in cross-borde", "source": "platform/商业生态系统视角下出口型跨境电商企业的海外战略分析_孙智佳.docx", "dimension": "platform", "tags": []},
    {"id": "PLATFORM-商业生态系统视角下出口型跨境电商企业的海-114", "title": "In terms of funding, Pinduoduo provides  Temu  with strong financial support. Ac", "content": "In terms of funding, Pinduoduo provides  Temu  with strong financial support. According to the financial report, in terms of revenue, Pinduoduo\'s operating income in 2022  was  130.558  billion yuan, a  year-on-year  increase of 39%  compared  with 2021; in terms of net profit, net profit attributable to common shareholders in 2022 was 31.538 billion yuan, a year-on-year increase of 30.6%; in terms of cash flow, as of December 31, 2022, Pinduoduo\'s cash, cash equivalents and short-term investments amounted   to   149.4   billion   yuan.   Since   Temu   went   live   in   September   2022, Pin", "source": "platform/商业生态系统视角下出口型跨境电商企业的海外战略分析_孙智佳.docx", "dimension": "platform", "tags": []},
