    {"id": "PLATFORM-商业生态系统视角下出口型跨境电商企业的海-116", "title": "In  terms  of supply  chain,  Pinduoduo  is  able  to  provide  strong  supply  ", "content": "In  terms  of supply  chain,  Pinduoduo  is  able  to  provide  strong  supply  chain support for Temu\'s low-priced, high-quality products. According to The Daily FRONT ROW, Pinduoduo has built a network covering more than 11 million suppliers in its long  years  of operation.  Since  2015,  Pinduoduo   has  cultivated  more  than  1,000 factory brands;  in 2018, Pinduoduo took the  lead  in  the  industry by  launching the “New   Brand   Program”,    which   provides    in-depth    cooperation   with    source manufacturers and brands. Relying on Pinduoduo,  Temu is able to directly reach the", "source": "platform/商业生态系统视角下出口型跨境电商企业的海外战略分析_孙智佳.docx", "dimension": "platform", "tags": []},
    {"id": "PLATFORM-商业生态系统视角下出口型跨境电商企业的海-117", "title": "Temu  adheres  to  the  self-management  model,  and  its  key  business  includ", "content": "Temu  adheres  to  the  self-management  model,  and  its  key  business  includes merchant   stationing,    product   selection,    price   negotiation,    merchant    delivery, marketing and promotion, order generation, fulfillment and delivery, and after-sales service. Among them, merchants are only responsible for supply and delivery to the warehouse, logistics companies, courier companies are responsible for delivery, and other links are responsible for the platform. Compared with Wish, a U.S. e-commerce platform whose value proposition is also low price and full range of products,  Temu\'", "source": "platform/商业生态系统视角下出口型跨境电商企业的海外战略分析_孙智佳.docx", "dimension": "platform", "tags": []},
    {"id": "PLATFORM-商业生态系统视角下出口型跨境电商企业的海-118", "title": "Chapter 4 Analysis ofTEMU’s Overseas Strategies and Potential Problems", "content": "Chapter 4 Analysis ofTEMU’s Overseas Strategies and Potential Problems", "source": "platform/商业生态系统视角下出口型跨境电商企业的海外战略分析_孙智佳.docx", "dimension": "platform", "tags": []},
    {"id": "PLATFORM-商业生态系统视角下出口型跨境电商企业的海-119", "title": "Since the reform and opening up, and especially since  its  accession to  WTO, C", "content": "Since the reform and opening up, and especially since  its  accession to  WTO, China  has been developing  foreign trade  as  an  important means of supporting its economic  growth. As the  largest developing country in the world today, China has nearly  one  fifth  of  the  world\'s  working  population  and   ranks  first  in  terms   of economic output and total import and export volume. From the annual data of import and export volume enterprises,  it  is  clearly that no matter how the world  economy changes,  China\'s  foreign  trade   has  been  maintaining  a  stable  development  trend.", "source": "platform/商业生态系统视角下出口型跨境电商企业的海外战略分析_孙智佳.docx", "dimension": "platform", "tags": []},
    {"id": "PLATFORM-商业生态系统视角下出口型跨境电商企业的海-120", "title": "Among them, cross-border e-commerce has stronger advantages over traditional for", "content": "Among them, cross-border e-commerce has stronger advantages over traditional foreign  trade  in  terms  of  supply  and  demand  information  transfer,  payment  and settlement, and transaction convenience, etc.  The  e-commerce channel is  gradually replacing  the  traditional  hierarchical  distribution   mechanism.   Import  and  export transactions  around  the  world  are  gradually  experiencing  the  penetration  of  e - commerce. In 2020, the penetration rate of China\'s cross-border e-commerce market in international trade has reached the world\'s thirty-ninth per cent. According to Ave", "source": "platform/商业生态系统视角下出口型跨境电商企业的海外战略分析_孙智佳.docx", "dimension": "platform", "tags": []},
    {"id": "PLATFORM-商业生态系统视角下出口型跨境电商企业的海-121", "title": "signing  of  RCEP,  the  Chinese   government  will   further  reduce   import  ", "content": "signing  of  RCEP,  the  Chinese   government  will   further  reduce   import  tariffs  in accordance with the agreement, and we can foresee that the business of importing will also receive  a spring  breeze.\n\nThe development trend of cross-border e-commerce  is  mainly  affected by the following  three factors:\n\n③ consumer  purchasing  habits.", "source": "platform/商业生态系统视角下出口型跨境电商企业的海外战略分析_孙智佳.docx", "dimension": "platform", "tags": []},
    {"id": "PLATFORM-商业生态系统视角下出口型跨境电商企业的海-122", "title": "As one of the major economies in the world, the United States ranks first in the", "content": "As one of the major economies in the world, the United States ranks first in the world in terms of consumer demand for products. However, the proportion of cross- border e-commerce sales  in the  U.S.  market to  overall domestic  e-commerce sales will still be only about  1%  in 2019,  far  less  than  China\'s  8%.  7By comparing  the development status of China  and the United  States  in the  above aspects, the  long- standing habit of U.S. consumers to use local offline channels for consumption is the main  reason.  Affected  by  the   epidemic,  the   U.S.  residents  have   changed  thei", "source": "platform/商业生态系统视角下出口型跨境电商企业的海外战略分析_孙智佳.docx", "dimension": "platform", "tags": []},
    {"id": "PLATFORM-商业生态系统视角下出口型跨境电商企业的海-123", "title": "7   Source: U.S. Department of Commerce, 2020 Euromonitor statistics.", "content": "7   Source: U.S. Department of Commerce, 2020 Euromonitor statistics.\n\n2Visions, 61% of apparel shoppers are more inclined to buy discounted goods, and the demand  for  low-priced  goods  overseas  is  gradually  increasing.  At  the  same  time, China\'s strong supply chain to support the adequate supply of cost-effective goods to better meet the growing demand for low-priced goods overseas, in this context, the full hosting model for the oversupply of factory-type merchants to provide a new way of shipments, by virtue of the price advantage of the rapid penetration of overseas sinking  market", "source": "platform/商业生态系统视角下出口型跨境电商企业的海外战略分析_孙智佳.docx", "dimension": "platform", "tags": []},
    {"id": "PLATFORM-商业生态系统视角下出口型跨境电商企业的海-124", "title": "Taking a  closer  look  at  customer  preferences  for  e-commerce  logistics,  ", "content": "Taking a  closer  look  at  customer  preferences  for  e-commerce  logistics,  it  is reflected that  individual consumers generally accept the  logistics delivery methods arranged by the platform, or choose among the several options given by the platform. Enterprise consumers, on the other hand, have a stronger willingness to use their own logistics  resources.  From  the   perspective  of  cross-border   e-commerce  logistics companies,  the  points  to  be  met  are  different.  The  business  built  through  the  e- commerce platform, individual consumers basically do not have direct cont", "source": "platform/商业生态系统视角下出口型跨境电商企业的海外战略分析_孙智佳.docx", "dimension": "platform", "tags": []},
    {"id": "PLATFORM-商业生态系统视角下出口型跨境电商企业的海-125", "title": "The profitability of cross-border e-commerce companies is extremely affected by ", "content": "The profitability of cross-border e-commerce companies is extremely affected by logistics  costs  and  efficiency.  China\'s  logistics  market  is  huge,  but  it  remains relatively  inefficient  compared  to  other  developed  markets.  Looking  at  the  cross- border e-commerce logistics industry alone, logistics costs account for about 20-30% of the transaction value. How to improve efficiency and optimise processes to reduce logistics  costs has become a challenge.\n\nThe current e-commerce logistics industry companies can be divided into three categories  according  to the roles of the par", "source": "platform/商业生态系统视角下出口型跨境电商企业的海外战略分析_孙智佳.docx", "dimension": "platform", "tags": []},
    {"id": "PLATFORM-商业生态系统视角下出口型跨境电商企业的海-126", "title": "① Resource providers  in  the  upstream,  including  but  not  limited  to  rele", "content": "① Resource providers  in  the  upstream,  including  but  not  limited  to  relevant software   development,   packaging   material   design   and   production,   automation equipment  R&D and production,  and trunk  line  network  laying.\n\n② Logistics  service  carriers, referring to  the  use  of the  above resources to provide transport, warehousing, delivery and additional services for merchants. (iii) Demand  side using  logistics  services  e.g. platforms,   enterprises,  individuals,   etc.", "source": "platform/商业生态系统视角下出口型跨境电商企业的海外战略分析_孙智佳.docx", "dimension": "platform", "tags": []},
    {"id": "PLATFORM-商业生态系统视角下出口型跨境电商企业的海-127", "title": "From the software point of view, e-commerce enterprises should have the ability ", "content": "From the software point of view, e-commerce enterprises should have the ability to accommodate the processing of huge orders, make use of big data, cloud computing, Internet of Things and other technologies to do a good job of resource rationing, and constantly  improve  its  automated  order  processing,   online  tracking,   information terminal  feedback  and  other  basic  requirements.  The  design  and  development  of packaging materials should meet the different requirements of different products on compression resistance  and  collision  safety  coefficient,  so  that  the  goods  can", "source": "platform/商业生态系统视角下出口型跨境电商企业的海外战略分析_孙智佳.docx", "dimension": "platform", "tags": []},
    {"id": "PLATFORM-商业生态系统视角下出口型跨境电商企业的海-128", "title": "4.1.1 Target group targeting  and platform  positioning", "content": "4.1.1 Target group targeting  and platform  positioning\n\nThe important reason why Temu has been able to rise rapidly in the United States in a short period of time and seize the  market share of many powerful competitors such as Amazon, Shein, Sizzle, TikTok, etc. is that it has a unique business model. In the  process  of  expanding  overseas   markets,   Temu  has  not  completely  copied Pinduoduo\'s business  model  in China,  nor  has  it completely  imitated  the  business\n\nmodel  of an  existing  cross-border   e-commerce  platform.   Instead,  based  on  the successful  experience  accu", "source": "platform/商业生态系统视角下出口型跨境电商企业的海外战略分析_孙智佳.docx", "dimension": "platform", "tags": []},
    {"id": "PLATFORM-商业生态系统视角下出口型跨境电商企业的海-129", "title": "(I) Customer segmentation: focusing on the sinking market and targeting low- end", "content": "(I) Customer segmentation: focusing on the sinking market and targeting low- end customers", "source": "platform/商业生态系统视角下出口型跨境电商企业的海外战略分析_孙智佳.docx", "dimension": "platform", "tags": []},
    {"id": "PLATFORM-商业生态系统视角下出口型跨境电商企业的海-130", "title": "Similar to Pinduoduo\'s focus on the sinking market, Temu\'s main customers are po", "content": "Similar to Pinduoduo\'s focus on the sinking market, Temu\'s main customers are positioned in the middle and low-end consumers to meet people\'s demand for cost- effective products.  According  to  ITBEAR  Technology  Information,   Temu\'s  target customers are  mainly  Asians or  low-income  consumers with  an annual  household income of less than 30,000 U.S. dollars.  The sinking U.S.  market  has seen greater demand due to the economic downturn. According to Zippa\'s research, as of October 2022, the share of lower-class people (with annual incomes of less than $42,000) in the U.S.  is  29%.  A", "source": "platform/商业生态系统视角下出口型跨境电商企业的海外战略分析_孙智佳.docx", "dimension": "platform", "tags": []},
    {"id": "PLATFORM-商业生态系统视角下出口型跨境电商企业的海-131", "title": "Shein mainly focus on women\'s clothing categories; known as the “U.S. version of", "content": "Shein mainly focus on women\'s clothing categories; known as the “U.S. version of Pinduoduo” Wish sales fell from 2.5 billion U.S. dollars in 2020 to 500  million U.S. dollars in 2022, the stock price fell 87%, and losses continue to expand. It can be seen that there is a lack of leaders in the low-end market ofU.S. e-commerce, which has a large growth potential.\n\n(ii) Value proposition: satisfy the demand  for  low prices  and provide a  more complete  range of categories:", "source": "platform/商业生态系统视角下出口型跨境电商企业的海外战略分析_孙智佳.docx", "dimension": "platform", "tags": []},
    {"id": "PLATFORM-商业生态系统视角下出口型跨境电商企业的海-132", "title": "Temu\'s value proposition is to provide customers with low-priced,  full-category", "content": "Temu\'s value proposition is to provide customers with low-priced,  full-category products, i.e., “to provide consumers with a variety of products at the lowest possible price. ”  Temu  attracts  a  large  number  of consumers  quickly  with  low  prices  and extreme cost-effectiveness in a short period of time, and its slogan is “Team Up, Price Its slogan is “Team Up, Price Down”,  i.e., “Buy together, only cheap”, and the price of similar single products in Temu is much lower than that ofShein and Amazon, with obvious price advantages. According to the sample statistics of Zhejiang Securities", "source": "platform/商业生态系统视角下出口型跨境电商企业的海外战略分析_孙智佳.docx", "dimension": "platform", "tags": []},
    {"id": "PLATFORM-商业生态系统视角下出口型跨境电商企业的海-133", "title": "Around the low price strategy, Temu also launched a number of discounts, such as", "content": "Around the low price strategy, Temu also launched a number of discounts, such as “1 cent choose 1”, “UP TO 90% OFF” and so on. At the same time, Temu also gave a “free” shipping strategy, so that the user from the product selection to the delivery of goods, the whole process has a “money-saving”  shopping  experience.", "source": "platform/商业生态系统视角下出口型跨境电商企业的海外战略分析_孙智佳.docx", "dimension": "platform", "tags": []},
    {"id": "PLATFORM-商业生态系统视角下出口型跨境电商企业的海-134", "title": "On the  other  hand,  compared  with  Shein\'s  strategy  of  focusing  on  women", "content": "On the  other  hand,  compared  with  Shein\'s  strategy  of  focusing  on  women\'s clothing, Temu provides consumers with a  full range of products, which can cover more  user  needs  and  user  groups.  According  to  McKinsey  2022  research,  sports apparel,  pet  supplies,  cosmetics,  and   software  and   electronics  are  four  popular categories  where  the  purchasing  power  of  U.S.  consumers  continues  to   rise. According to Zheshang Securities, Temu\'s official website is set up with 29 first-level categories and 339 second-level categories, with daily hundreds of supplies, clot", "source": "platform/商业生态系统视角下出口型跨境电商企业的海外战略分析_孙智佳.docx", "dimension": "platform", "tags": []},
    {"id": "PLATFORM-商业生态系统视角下出口型跨境电商企业的海-135", "title": "and footwear, and 3C digital as the main best-selling categories. According to H", "content": "and footwear, and 3C digital as the main best-selling categories. According to Huatai Securities, as of October 2022, Temu\'s categories that account for a higher GMV are mother   and  baby  products,   home   kitchen  products,   shoes,   women\'s   clothing, electronic  products  and appliances,  and jewelry.\n\n(iii)  Channel  access:  increasing  user  touchpoints  and  multi-channel  traffic acquisition", "source": "platform/商业生态系统视角下出口型跨境电商企业的海外战略分析_孙智佳.docx", "dimension": "platform", "tags": []},
    {"id": "PLATFORM-商业生态系统视角下出口型跨境电商企业的海-136", "title": "Temu acquires customers through multi-channel traffic diversion such as direct t", "content": "Temu acquires customers through multi-channel traffic diversion such as direct traffic, external links,  search,  social,  email and display ads. According to ZSE,  in November 2022,  direct  traffic  was  Temu\'s  largest  source  of customer  acquisition, accounting for 45.56%. Followed by social, search, and advertisements accounting for 18.04%, 15.97%, and 13.42%, respectively. In terms of APP downloads, according to data.ai, Temu was ranked No. 1 in the U.S. Apple Store and Google Play download charts for shopping applications, and as ofthe end of June 2023, Temu had more than 70 million d", "source": "platform/商业生态系统视角下出口型跨境电商企业的海外战略分析_孙智佳.docx", "dimension": "platform", "tags": []},
    {"id": "PLATFORM-商业生态系统视角下出口型跨境电商企业的海-137", "title": "(iv) Customer relationship:  Enhance  user interaction  and user stickiness", "content": "(iv) Customer relationship:  Enhance  user interaction  and user stickiness\n\nIn  terms  of  customer  relationship,   Temu   interacts  with  consumers  through discount promotions, introduction of games, after-sales service, etc., to enhance the freshness  and experience  of consumers  and establish  good customer  relationship.\n\nTemu also launches limited-time ultra-low price promotions from time to time to allow users to enjoy lower prices; it also increases user participation and interactivity, such as through the introduction of small games such as solitaire,  where consumers can win free", "source": "platform/商业生态系统视角下出口型跨境电商企业的海外战略分析_孙智佳.docx", "dimension": "platform", "tags": []},
    {"id": "PLATFORM-商业生态系统视角下出口型跨境电商企业的海-138", "title": "In addition, in terms of after-sales service, Temu implements an unconditional r", "content": "In addition, in terms of after-sales service, Temu implements an unconditional return policy within 90 days, and the return link platform further encourages users to leave the goods by giving discount refunds, which in turn improves users\' mind and boosts  repurchase.   According  to   China  Merchants   Securities,   Temu   users   are relatively satisfied with the quality of products and services, and the return rate  is lower than the industry  average.", "source": "platform/商业生态系统视角下出口型跨境电商企业的海外战略分析_孙智佳.docx", "dimension": "platform", "tags": []},
    {"id": "PLATFORM-商业生态系统视角下出口型跨境电商企业的海-139", "title": "With the  series  of initiatives  mentioned  above,  Temu  has  established  a  ", "content": "With the  series  of initiatives  mentioned  above,  Temu  has  established  a  good customer relationship, which not only meets consumers\' demand for low-priced goods and  improves  user  stickiness, but  also brings  more  user  traffic  and  orders,  thus forming a virtuous cycle. According to 36 Krypton data, as of February 2023, Temu\'s reorder  rate  was  around  10%,  slightly  higher  than  its  competitors.  According  to Bloomberg data, Temu\'s user retention rate in the U.S. market has continued to grow since December 2022, approaching  50% in May 2023, significantly  higher  than  Sh", "source": "platform/商业生态系统视角下出口型跨境电商企业的海外战略分析_孙智佳.docx", "dimension": "platform", "tags": []},
    {"id": "PLATFORM-商业生态系统视角下出口型跨境电商企业的海-140", "title": "In terms of business  model,  Temu\'s  fully  managed  model  helps  the  platfor", "content": "In terms of business  model,  Temu\'s  fully  managed  model  helps  the  platform screen  out  the  best   suppliers  with  the  highest  production  capacity  and   remove intermediate  links such as distributors, thus realizing the  improvement of business efficiency. Pinduoduo adopts a fully managed self-operated business model, in which", "source": "platform/商业生态系统视角下出口型跨境电商企业的海外战略分析_孙智佳.docx", "dimension": "platform", "tags": []},
    {"id": "PLATFORM-商业生态系统视角下出口型跨境电商企业的海-141", "title": "the platform assumes or replaces the functions of multiple layers of distributor", "content": "the platform assumes or replaces the functions of multiple layers of distributors, and lets  consumers  benefit   from  the  profits  released  by  the  shortened   supply  chain, creating a significant price advantage and attracting consumers, thus opening up the cycle  between  more  consumers  and   more  sales.  In  addition,  suppliers  are  only responsible for the “production” and  “delivery to domestic warehouse” segments, so manufacturers only need to maximize production costs, and cross-border logistics and operations  are  basically   zero  threshold.   On   this  basis,   Temu   ca", "source": "platform/商业生态系统视角下出口型跨境电商企业的海外战略分析_孙智佳.docx", "dimension": "platform", "tags": []},
    {"id": "PLATFORM-商业生态系统视角下出口型跨境电商企业的海-142", "title": "On the  Temu platform,  merchants  can post their products on the shelves and su", "content": "On the  Temu platform,  merchants  can post their products on the shelves and supply them to buyers through backend posting merchant background stationing and commodity supply.Merchants can choose their own product categories and pricing, and adjust them according to market demand.Temu has the final pricing authority, but merchants   can   set  reasonable   prices  based   on   their   own   costs   and   market competition.Merchants\' products will be reviewed and screened by Temu, and those that meet the criteria will enter the supply pool. Temu will integrate the products  into its own suppl", "source": "platform/商业生态系统视角下出口型跨境电商企业的海外战略分析_孙智佳.docx", "dimension": "platform", "tags": []},
    {"id": "PLATFORM-商业生态系统视角下出口型跨境电商企业的海-143", "title": "4.1.3 Front-end  marketing  promotion", "content": "4.1.3 Front-end  marketing  promotion\n\nTemu\'s traffic comes mainly from direct visits (about 44%), social media traffic (mainly  from  Facebook  and  Youtube,  21.5%),  natural  search  (7.3%),  paid  search (16.2%), and display ad traffic  (3.5%) Attracting Traffic and Customer Acquisition Costs.8", "source": "platform/商业生态系统视角下出口型跨境电商企业的海外战略分析_孙智佳.docx", "dimension": "platform", "tags": []},
    {"id": "PLATFORM-商业生态系统视角下出口型跨境电商企业的海-144", "title": "Temu (Team Up,  Price  Down)  allows  consumers  to  quickly  understand  the co", "content": "Temu (Team Up,  Price  Down)  allows  consumers  to  quickly  understand  the connotation of affordable group, and the main color of the APP is passionate orange, which is more likely to stimulate people\'s desire to consume. In terms of marketing and  customer  acquisition,  Temu  adopts  a  multi-channel  marketing  and  promotion strategy,  including  social  media, content promotion and  affiliate  marketing.  In the cold-launch phase,  the  platform  uses  social  media  platforms  such  as  Facebook, Instagram,  Tik-Tok,  etc. to display the products  and  conduct  unboxing reviews to att", "source": "platform/商业生态系统视角下出口型跨境电商企业的海外战略分析_孙智佳.docx", "dimension": "platform", "tags": []},
