    {"id": "PLATFORM-商业生态系统视角下出口型跨境电商企业的海-146", "title": "influence and power of speech in a specific group of people, and there is no abs", "content": "influence and power of speech in a specific group of people, and there is no absolute limit to the scope of the group, which can be as large as an industry, and can be as large as an industry. There is no absolute limit to the scope of this group, which can be as large as an industry, a subculture circle, or as small as an interest group.  Temu also emphasizes KOL (Key Opinion Leader refers to a person who has great influence and power of speech in a specific group, and there is no absolute limit to the  scope of this group, which can be as large as an industry, a subculture circle, or as smal", "source": "platform/商业生态系统视角下出口型跨境电商企业的海外战略分析_孙智佳.docx", "dimension": "platform", "tags": []},
    {"id": "PLATFORM-商业生态系统视角下出口型跨境电商企业的海-147", "title": "The  huge  marketing  spend  has  accelerated   Temu\'s journey  into  millions  ", "content": "The  huge  marketing  spend  has  accelerated   Temu\'s journey  into  millions  of homes. Such a staggering investment has also directly changed the entire landscape of outbound e-commerce. Facts have proved that Temu\'s extreme  low price + money marketing play is  very effective. One  year after  its  launch,  Temu  has  gained  200 million downloads in the developed markets of Europe and the United States. From the performance of Temu\'s initial launch in the U.S., it is easy to realize the “curved", "source": "platform/商业生态系统视角下出口型跨境电商企业的海外战略分析_孙智佳.docx", "dimension": "platform", "tags": []},
    {"id": "PLATFORM-商业生态系统视角下出口型跨境电商企业的海-148", "title": "road to overtake” in the sinking market of countries with high purchasing power ", "content": "road to overtake” in the sinking market of countries with high purchasing power by using the low price strategy to capture the market. At the same time, Temu recognizes that its U.S. competitors are fighting back and that its order growth is slowing, and is choosing to invest its resources in new, faster-growing markets. To that end, Temu is accelerating  its  entry into more countries  and regions.\n\n4.1.4 Channel  traffic exploitation", "source": "platform/商业生态系统视角下出口型跨境电商企业的海外战略分析_孙智佳.docx", "dimension": "platform", "tags": []},
    {"id": "PLATFORM-商业生态系统视角下出口型跨境电商企业的海-149", "title": "Temu is aggressively pursuing traffic acquisition strategies.While  Amazon still", "content": "Temu is aggressively pursuing traffic acquisition strategies.While  Amazon still leads in active users, Temu is well ahead of all of its competitors in both total minutes of daily use and minutes of daily use per user. According to GWS Magnify statistics for the  month of October 2023,  Temu  had  120  million  minutes  of usage per day, compared to Amazon\'s 79 million minutes of usage per day and SHEIN\'s  16 million minutes of usage per day. In terms of minutes per user per day, Amazon and SHEIN users spend 8.7 and 8.8 minutes per day on the app, respectively, while Temu users spend 22.4 minu", "source": "platform/商业生态系统视角下出口型跨境电商企业的海外战略分析_孙智佳.docx", "dimension": "platform", "tags": []},
    {"id": "PLATFORM-商业生态系统视角下出口型跨境电商企业的海-150", "title": "As  a  newer  player  in  the  e-commerce  space,  Temu  has  a  different  traf", "content": "As  a  newer  player  in  the  e-commerce  space,  Temu  has  a  different  traffic structure compared to more established platforms like Amazon or Shein. Temu have a higher  reliance  on  paid  acquisition  channels  (e.g.  social  media  ads,  search  ads, affiliate partnerships) to drive initial awareness and user growth.In contrast, longer- standing platforms may have built up a stronger base of organic traffic through factors like brand recognition, SEO, and word-of-mouth.Temu\'s traffic structure could also be more heavily skewed towards mobile/app channels, as they prioritize a mobile-fi", "source": "platform/商业生态系统视角下出口型跨境电商企业的海外战略分析_孙智佳.docx", "dimension": "platform", "tags": []},
    {"id": "PLATFORM-商业生态系统视角下出口型跨境电商企业的海-151", "title": "Paid  Advertising:  As  mentioned,   Temu  is  investing  heavily  in  paid  dig", "content": "Paid  Advertising:  As  mentioned,   Temu  is  investing  heavily  in  paid  digital advertising across social media, search engines, and other channels to rapidly acquire new users.\n\nReferral/Affiliate Programs: Temu    incentivize existing customers,  influencers, or partners to refer new users through special offers, commission-based promotions, etc.\n\nApp  Store Optimization (ASO): Temu focus on optimizing their mobile app\'s presence and discoverability  in app stores to drive  downloads  and engagement.\n\nStrategic  Partnerships:  Temu  could   strike  partnerships  with  complementary bran", "source": "platform/商业生态系统视角下出口型跨境电商企业的海外战略分析_孙智佳.docx", "dimension": "platform", "tags": []},
    {"id": "PLATFORM-商业生态系统视角下出口型跨境电商企业的海-152", "title": "As a newer platform, Temu needs to quickly build up a critical mass of active us", "content": "As a newer platform, Temu needs to quickly build up a critical mass of active users to compete with more established players. Temu\'s low-cost supply chain model allows  them to  be  more  aggressive  with  discounts  and  promotions  to  drive  user acquisition.Paid ads, partnerships, and other tactics help Temu build brand awareness and credibility in a crowded market.Acquiring more users also gives Temu more data to optimize  their platform, offerings, and  marketing strategies over time.Impulsive consumers make up a higher percentage of TEMU transactions and are a big reason why traffic  pl", "source": "platform/商业生态系统视角下出口型跨境电商企业的海外战略分析_孙智佳.docx", "dimension": "platform", "tags": []},
    {"id": "PLATFORM-商业生态系统视角下出口型跨境电商企业的海-153", "title": "In the cross-border e-commerce business,  large  merchants  often have complex b", "content": "In the cross-border e-commerce business,  large  merchants  often have complex business   scenarios,   such   as    merchants    in   the   major    e-commerce   platforms, independent stations, overseas stores have sales business,  generating  multi-channel orders. In the domestic and overseas may be at the same time multiple warehouses, warehouses  distributed  in  different  countries,   merchants  cooperate  with   multiple logistics  carriers,  different carriers  have  different  time,  cost,  service.  Accordingly, merchants  will  also face  complex  operations  and decision-making.", "source": "platform/商业生态系统视角下出口型跨境电商企业的海外战略分析_孙智佳.docx", "dimension": "platform", "tags": []},
    {"id": "PLATFORM-商业生态系统视角下出口型跨境电商企业的海-154", "title": "TEMU\'s  Order  Management  System  (OMS)   is  an  information  management syste", "content": "TEMU\'s  Order  Management  System  (OMS)   is  an  information  management system for full life cycle management, complex decision-making and analysis of all orders generated by merchants\' platform transactions; it supports inquiries, creation, centralization, auditing, modification, splitting, merging, cancellation, and archiving of orders; for merchants, OMS orders  are mainly from two sources, namely online orders and offline orders. For merchants, OMS orders are mainly from two sources: online  orders and offline  orders.", "source": "platform/商业生态系统视角下出口型跨境电商企业的海外战略分析_孙智佳.docx", "dimension": "platform", "tags": []},
    {"id": "PLATFORM-商业生态系统视角下出口型跨境电商企业的海-155", "title": "Usually, the  most mainstream cross-border e-commerce  merchants  sell  in  the ", "content": "Usually, the  most mainstream cross-border e-commerce  merchants  sell  in  the mainstream cross-border e-commerce platforms, such as Amazon, ebay, shein and so on. The advantage of being stationed on the platform is to enjoy the traffic of the platform  itself,  which  is  conducive  to  the  sale  of  goods,  but  the  corresponding\n\ndisadvantages  are  also  obvious,  the  business  activities  of  merchants   are  strictly regulated  by  the  platform,   and  they  do   not   have   much  autonomy   in  pricing, promotions,  and operational  activities.", "source": "platform/商业生态系统视角下出口型跨境电商企业的海外战略分析_孙智佳.docx", "dimension": "platform", "tags": []},
    {"id": "PLATFORM-商业生态系统视角下出口型跨境电商企业的海-156", "title": "When the merchant has more than one overseas warehouse, the order should be ship", "content": "When the merchant has more than one overseas warehouse, the order should be shipped from which warehouse, usually consider shipping from the nearest warehouse. Unlike domestic order fulfillment, overseas order fulfillment also takes into account customs clearance. The closest overseas warehouse is not necessarily the most cost- effective shipping warehouse, and cross-border shipments often incur high tariffs and import VAT.", "source": "platform/商业生态系统视角下出口型跨境电商企业的海外战略分析_孙智佳.docx", "dimension": "platform", "tags": []},
    {"id": "PLATFORM-商业生态系统视角下出口型跨境电商企业的海-157", "title": "TEMU\'s fully managed model solves the problem of merchants cooperating with mult", "content": "TEMU\'s fully managed model solves the problem of merchants cooperating with multiple carriers to transport parcels for them, and when the delivery fails or the order return problem arises, the goods in the parcels often cannot be returned to the country because the cost of returning the  goods to  the  country is even higher than that of discarding the goods directly, and in addition, it may also  incur import taxes. It also avoids the cost of goods after a fulfillment  failure,   a risk merchants  often have to bear.\n\n4.2.1 False declaration of goods value", "source": "platform/商业生态系统视角下出口型跨境电商企业的海外战略分析_孙智佳.docx", "dimension": "platform", "tags": []},
    {"id": "PLATFORM-商业生态系统视角下出口型跨境电商企业的海-158", "title": "E-commerce   innovations    alone   don\'t    explain   Temu\'s    low   prices.  ", "content": "E-commerce   innovations    alone   don\'t    explain   Temu\'s    low   prices.    Many lawmakers accuse Temu of abusing a loophole in U.S. import tax and obscure U.S. law helped Temu\'s  meteoric rise.The  loophole  lets  companies  skip  import  fees  for smaller-value shipments, and Temu uses that rule when shipping individual packages to people\'s homes rather than importing in bulk to a warehouse. obscure U.S.  law helped Temu\'s  meteoric  rise\n\nThe  rule  in  question  is  called  de   minimis,  a   legal  term  for  something  too insignificant  in  value  to bother  imposing  duties.  The", "source": "platform/商业生态系统视角下出口型跨境电商企业的海外战略分析_孙智佳.docx", "dimension": "platform", "tags": []},
    {"id": "PLATFORM-商业生态系统视角下出口型跨境电商企业的海-159", "title": "$200, but it rose to $800 in 2016 — among the highest in the world — when then- ", "content": "$200, but it rose to $800 in 2016 — among the highest in the world — when then- President  Barack   Obama   signed   the   bipartisan   Trade   Facilitation   and    Trade Enforcement Act.Both Temu and Shein rely heavily on the de minimis exception to ship packages directly to U.S. consumers allowing them to provide less robust data to Customs and Border Protection and avoid import duties. The U.S. -China Economic and  Security  Review  Commission  (USCC)  under  the  U.S.  Congress  released  an analyst report that found cross-border e-commerce platforms Temu and other Chinese e-commerce comp", "source": "platform/商业生态系统视角下出口型跨境电商企业的海外战略分析_孙智佳.docx", "dimension": "platform", "tags": []},
    {"id": "PLATFORM-商业生态系统视角下出口型跨境电商企业的海-160", "title": "4.2.2 Counterfeit  goods and trademark  infringement  issues", "content": "4.2.2 Counterfeit  goods and trademark  infringement  issues\n\nIn addition, the U.S. market business closed-loop ecosystem is difficult to  form, the platform service system is facing a test. In the e-commerce review service website Trustpilot, overseas consumers evaluation is very polarised, 61% of users gave 4 stars and 5 stars positive feedback, 32% of users gave 1 star and 2 stars bad reviews, of which the bad reviews  are mainly  focused  on quality  issues.", "source": "platform/商业生态系统视角下出口型跨境电商企业的海外战略分析_孙智佳.docx", "dimension": "platform", "tags": []},
    {"id": "PLATFORM-商业生态系统视角下出口型跨境电商企业的海-161", "title": "Copyright issues   pose a huge risk, with Temu and its parent company named as d", "content": "Copyright issues   pose a huge risk, with Temu and its parent company named as defendants in at least 50 trademark or copyright infringement lawsuits in the U.S., and lawsuits have become a regular occurrence for Temu. Nike, Dex UGG, Levi Strauss, Stussy, Oakley sunglasses, and online retailer Dolls Kill have all accused  Temu of stealing  their  designs,  claiming  that  they  have   infringed  on  their  copyrights  and trademarks, and seeking damages and injunctions alleging that Temu has infringed on their designs in a number of cases. infringed on their designs.SHEIN sued Temu in the Unit", "source": "platform/商业生态系统视角下出口型跨境电商企业的海外战略分析_孙智佳.docx", "dimension": "platform", "tags": []},
    {"id": "PLATFORM-商业生态系统视角下出口型跨境电商企业的海-162", "title": "Boston alleging  that  SHEIN  violated  U.S.  antitrust  laws  in  its  dealings", "content": "Boston alleging  that  SHEIN  violated  U.S.  antitrust  laws  in  its  dealings  with  the apparel maker, stating in the complaint that \"as of 2022, SHEIN owns more than 75 per cent of the U.S. ultra-fast fashion market. \" Most notably, Temu specifically states that SHEIN \"used its dominant market power to  force apparel manufacturers to enter into exclusive agreements with it, preventing them from working with Temu. \" While embroiled in numerous litigation disputes, Temu and SHEIN are also at risk of falling further  into  a vicious  competition  due to their  ecological  proximity.\n\n4.3 Sta", "source": "platform/商业生态系统视角下出口型跨境电商企业的海外战略分析_孙智佳.docx", "dimension": "platform", "tags": []},
    {"id": "PLATFORM-商业生态系统视角下出口型跨境电商企业的海-163", "title": "1.   Cross-border e-commerce platforms: such as the Temu platforms in this case,", "content": "1.   Cross-border e-commerce platforms: such as the Temu platforms in this case, are key linking  points  in the ecosystem  that play a dominant  role.\n\n2.   On the buyer\'s  side: buyers  are  diverse  in their  identities: traders, buyers, brands, retailers, online shop owners. The buyers\' size hierarchy is dispersed: large multinationals,  small  and  medium-sized  enterprises  (SMEs),  micro-merchants  and individuals.\n\n3.   Seller side: offline  foreign trade enterprises, domestic  merchants in the field of  e-commerce.   Mainly  distributed  in  Guangdong,  Zhejiang,  Fujian  and  other p", "source": "platform/商业生态系统视角下出口型跨境电商企业的海外战略分析_孙智佳.docx", "dimension": "platform", "tags": []},
    {"id": "PLATFORM-商业生态系统视角下出口型跨境电商企业的海-164", "title": "4.   Service  Providers:  In  B2B business,  it  involves  customs  declaration ", "content": "4.   Service  Providers:  In  B2B business,  it  involves  customs  declaration  and inspection, tax rebate and exchange clearance,  freight  forwarding,  shipping,  etc.  In B2C, it involves  cross-border courier,  parcel,  credit  card and third-party  payment.\n\n5.   Government regulatory agencies: Customs, commodity inspection, tax, and layman\'s  administration.\n\nSynergism is the process by which the components of a system cooperate with each other to bring the system to a stable state. Although different ecosystems have different internal components and system structures, from the point of", "source": "platform/商业生态系统视角下出口型跨境电商企业的海外战略分析_孙智佳.docx", "dimension": "platform", "tags": []},
    {"id": "PLATFORM-商业生态系统视角下出口型跨境电商企业的海-165", "title": "environments, the internal elements of the system cooperate and interact with ea", "content": "environments, the internal elements of the system cooperate and interact with each other, so that the system moves from a state of disorder to an orderly and stable state. Within the system,  if the  elements can cooperate  and share  information resources, then  it  may  produce  the  effect  of  \"1+1>2\",   promoting  the  stable  and  healthy development  of the  system;  if  the  elements  of  vicious  competition,   information sharing, although it seems that the short-term gain benefits  for their own benefit, but in the long run, it will only exacerbate the speed of its decline, and the ", "source": "platform/商业生态系统视角下出口型跨境电商企业的海外战略分析_孙智佳.docx", "dimension": "platform", "tags": []},
    {"id": "PLATFORM-商业生态系统视角下出口型跨境电商企业的海-166", "title": "Synergism emphasises the  self-organisation  of the  system,  in  the  absence  ", "content": "Synergism emphasises the  self-organisation  of the  system,  in  the  absence  of external control,  the  members within the  system  collaborate  with each other, thus bringing benefits and promoting the prosperity and stability of the system. The theory of synergetics shows that the relationship between populations  in an ecosystem  is mainly  symbiotic.   Located  in  the  cross-border   e-commerce  ecosystem,   the  five populations cooperate with each other, and share  information resources among the populations  to  promote   their   own  development.   Symbiotic  relationships   mainly", "source": "platform/商业生态系统视角下出口型跨境电商企业的海外战略分析_孙智佳.docx", "dimension": "platform", "tags": []},
    {"id": "PLATFORM-商业生态系统视角下出口型跨境电商企业的海-167", "title": "Parasitism: refers to the dependence of a population on other populations  for s", "content": "Parasitism: refers to the dependence of a population on other populations  for survival, drawing from other populations the  nutrients they need. In the cross-border e-commerce ecosystem, some professional talent training organisations rely on cross- border e-commerce platforms and specialise in cultivating some anchor with goods to carry out  online  live  streaming  with  goods,  so  as  to  gain  profits.  For  example, Alibaba\'s  Speedway  proposed   in  2020   that   it  would   launch  a  global  netroots incubation programme, with netroots bringing goods live through the cross-border e-", "source": "platform/商业生态系统视角下出口型跨境电商企业的海外战略分析_孙智佳.docx", "dimension": "platform", "tags": []},
    {"id": "PLATFORM-商业生态系统视角下出口型跨境电商企业的海-168", "title": "credibility and reputation of the merchants are questioned, but also the cross-b", "content": "credibility and reputation of the merchants are questioned, but also the cross-border e- commerce  platform  will  be implicated.", "source": "platform/商业生态系统视角下出口型跨境电商企业的海外战略分析_孙智佳.docx", "dimension": "platform", "tags": []},
    {"id": "PLATFORM-商业生态系统视角下出口型跨境电商企业的海-169", "title": "Biased  symbiosis:  populations  co-operate  and  relate  to  each  other,  but ", "content": "Biased  symbiosis:  populations  co-operate  and  relate  to  each  other,  but  the relationship only benefits one of the populations and has no effect on the other. Cross- border e-commerce platforms issue coupons and subsidies on their platforms in the course of development to win consumers\' trust. For example, Pinduoduo\'s 10 billion yuan subsidy, in order to promote the purchase of products by users, directly subsidise the goods on the platform. For consumers, participating in subsidy activities on the platform to buy goods at a low price; for cross-border e-commerce platforms platform com", "source": "platform/商业生态系统视角下出口型跨境电商企业的海外战略分析_孙智佳.docx", "dimension": "platform", "tags": []},
    {"id": "PLATFORM-商业生态系统视角下出口型跨境电商企业的海-170", "title": "Mutually beneficial symbiosis: refers  to  the  synergistic  cooperation  betwee", "content": "Mutually beneficial symbiosis: refers  to  the  synergistic  cooperation  between populations to promote each other\'s  long-term development and bring  long-lasting benefits to both partners.  The core, key, supporting and parasitic populations  in the cross-border  e-commerce  ecosystem  work  together  to  reduce  their  own  operating costs  and  the  impact  of  risks.  Mutualistic  symbiosis  within  the  cross-border  e- commerce ecosystem  is  mainly  manifested  in  two  ways.  The  first  is  that  supplier populations sell various products and services through the cross-border e-comm", "source": "platform/商业生态系统视角下出口型跨境电商企业的海外战略分析_孙智佳.docx", "dimension": "platform", "tags": []},
    {"id": "PLATFORM-商业生态系统视角下出口型跨境电商企业的海-171", "title": "terminate the supplier\'s Amazon sales account and discard all the counterfeit go", "content": "terminate the supplier\'s Amazon sales account and discard all the counterfeit goods stored in the Amazon operation centre, and the relevant costs incurred will be borne by the supplier  itself.  In addition,  the  supplier  will  not  receive payment  until the platform  confirms  that  the  consumer  has  received  the   genuine  product  ordered. Second: To  facilitate  cross-border transactions, cross-border e-commerce platforms collaborate  with  various  supporting  companies  to  promote  their  own  sustainable development. For the cross-border e-commerce platform, the synergy will enab", "source": "platform/商业生态系统视角下出口型跨境电商企业的海外战略分析_孙智佳.docx", "dimension": "platform", "tags": []},
    {"id": "PLATFORM-商业生态系统视角下出口型跨境电商企业的海-172", "title": "4.4 Temu Platform Business Model Analysis", "content": "4.4 Temu Platform Business Model Analysis\n\n(1) Differences  in product areas\n\nPoundland Temu is known for its group buys and low-priced goods. Through the model of centralised purchasing and social sharing, Poundland  Temu has managed to sell goods at low prices. In contrast, SHEIN, a cross-border e-commerce platform that focuses on fashionable women\'s clothing, offers consumers a wide range of trendy and fashionable clothing, shoes, accessories and other products. In terms of product", "source": "platform/商业生态系统视角下出口型跨境电商企业的海外战略分析_孙智佳.docx", "dimension": "platform", "tags": []},
    {"id": "PLATFORM-商业生态系统视角下出口型跨境电商企业的海-173", "title": "areas, Jinduoduo Temu mainly focuses on relatively low-priced goods, while SHEIN", "content": "areas, Jinduoduo Temu mainly focuses on relatively low-priced goods, while SHEIN focuses more on fashion and branding. Temu is based on a \"self-supporting\" model, in which merchants only provide goods, which is equivalent to a supply chain. Temu is mainly  a  \"self-operated\"  model,  where   merchants  only  provide   goods,  which  is equivalent to the supply chain, and  Temu is responsible for pricing,  sales, marketing, logistics, after-sales, etc.  Self-supporting  merchants are also known as  \"suppliers\", merchants are only responsible for providing goods, Temu order procurement form of c", "source": "platform/商业生态系统视角下出口型跨境电商企业的海外战略分析_孙智佳.docx", "dimension": "platform", "tags": []},
    {"id": "PLATFORM-商业生态系统视角下出口型跨境电商企业的海-174", "title": "(2) Differences  in business  models  and user groups", "content": "(2) Differences  in business  models  and user groups\n\nPinduoduo Temu uses a group-buying model where users can enjoy lower prices by inviting friends and participating in group-buying. This model promotes interaction and sharing among users and is suitable for consumers who enjoy group buying and seek affordable prices. In contrast, SHEIN is a cross-border e-commerce platform that focuses on personalised  shopping,  with a  greater  emphasis  on personalisation and quality.\n\n(3) Differences  in  commodity  sources", "source": "platform/商业生态系统视角下出口型跨境电商企业的海外战略分析_孙智佳.docx", "dimension": "platform", "tags": []},
    {"id": "PLATFORM-商业生态系统视角下出口型跨境电商企业的海-175", "title": "Pinduoduo   Temu\'s   merchandise   is   mainly   sourced   from   suppliers   on", "content": "Pinduoduo   Temu\'s   merchandise   is   mainly   sourced   from   suppliers   on   the Pinduoduo  platform,  which  are  vetted  and  screened  by  Pinduoduo  to  ensure  the quality and reliability of the merchandise. This approach allows Temu to offer more internationally  popular  fashion  items  with  high  quality  and brand recognition.\n\nWhen choosing  the  right  e-commerce  platform  for  them,  consumers  need  to consider their needs and preferences. If the buyer is more concerned about affordable prices and enjoys group buying and social interaction, then Poundland Temu maybe a bett", "source": "platform/商业生态系统视角下出口型跨境电商企业的海外战略分析_孙智佳.docx", "dimension": "platform", "tags": []},
    {"id": "PLATFORM-商业生态系统视角下出口型跨境电商企业的海-176", "title": "also be considered. If you are a shopper looking for everyday essentials or bulk", "content": "also be considered. If you are a shopper looking for everyday essentials or bulk items, Poundland Temu offers many affordable options. However, if buyers are looking for unique  fashion  pieces,  SHEIN\'s  international  fashion  collaborations  may  be  more appealing  to you.\n\nUser experience is also an important consideration. Both Poundland  Temu and SHEIN have invested a lot of resources in the user interface and shopping experience, but their websites and apps may differ  in design and  functionality due  to different target audiences. Hence, try and compare the shopping experience of bot", "source": "platform/商业生态系统视角下出口型跨境电商企业的海外战略分析_孙智佳.docx", "dimension": "platform", "tags": []},
    {"id": "PLATFORM-商业生态系统视角下出口型跨境电商企业的海-177", "title": "Compared to Temu, which focuses on distribution, SHEIN\'s logistics focuses on wa", "content": "Compared to Temu, which focuses on distribution, SHEIN\'s logistics focuses on warehousing due to the difference in platform types. Although the  SHEIN platform does not have  \"direct\" logistics support,  the performance and efforts of the  SHEIN platform in  logistics and  warehousing  are  also  worthy of recognition.  In order to improve  logistics  efficiency,  SHEIN  platform  in  the  warehousing  and   logistics management industry with the help of leading enterprises co-developed an intelligent management system \"Xianglong\" and cloud TMS system \"Ruilin\". The purpose of the two is based ", "source": "platform/商业生态系统视角下出口型跨境电商企业的海外战略分析_孙智佳.docx", "dimension": "platform", "tags": []},
    {"id": "PLATFORM-商业生态系统视角下出口型跨境电商企业的海-178", "title": "In addition to the support of advanced systems,  SHEIN Platform also  actively e", "content": "In addition to the support of advanced systems,  SHEIN Platform also  actively explores  other  excellent  logistics  companies  in  China  based  on  its  own  business model.In December 2018, SHEIN Platform and Vanke Logistics signed a strategic co- operation agreement in Hangzhou to strengthen the penetration in third- and fourth- tier  cities  through  sunken  warehouse   layouts.SHEIN   Platform  will   utilise  the platform\'s quality and scale advantages to help new cross-border bonded warehouses introduce SHEIN platform will leverage its quality and scale advantages to help new\n\ncross-b", "source": "platform/商业生态系统视角下出口型跨境电商企业的海外战略分析_孙智佳.docx", "dimension": "platform", "tags": []},
    {"id": "PLATFORM-商业生态系统视角下出口型跨境电商企业的海-179", "title": "Temu has copied the strategy of Pinduoduo in China to achieve  \"absolute low pri", "content": "Temu has copied the strategy of Pinduoduo in China to achieve  \"absolute low price\" supply, relying on the fully managed model to achieve the ultimate efficiency of the supply chain with the role of a  self-owned  \"super  seller\".The  core  value of Temu\'s choice of the fully managed model lies in the following:(1) On the platform side, the right of product selection and pricing is collected, so as to ensure that the price of all categories on the whole platform is pressed to the extreme, and the optimal solution of the platform\'s traffic and resource distribution is achieved on the macro leve", "source": "platform/商业生态系统视角下出口型跨境电商企业的海外战略分析_孙智佳.docx", "dimension": "platform", "tags": []},
    {"id": "PLATFORM-商业生态系统视角下出口型跨境电商企业的海-180", "title": "With  low  daily  price  and  large-scale  tournament  marketing,  the  platform", "content": "With  low  daily  price  and  large-scale  tournament  marketing,  the  platform  is rapidly gaining momentum. When comparing the prices of online platforms, Temu is more competitive than Amazon and  SHEIN; when comparing the prices of offline channels,  Temu  has  outstanding  advantages  in  terms  of  \"more\"  and   \"savings\". Looking forward to 2024, Temu will continue to innovate its business model, focusing on full hosting, supplemented by book-to-book, and  find another way to enrich the platform\'s product offerings. The platform\'s choice to launch the B2B business at this point  in time", "source": "platform/商业生态系统视角下出口型跨境电商企业的海外战略分析_孙智佳.docx", "dimension": "platform", "tags": []},
    {"id": "PLATFORM-商业生态系统视角下出口型跨境电商企业的海-181", "title": "platform\'s proportion of ocean freight will increase, optimising its cost struct", "content": "platform\'s proportion of ocean freight will increase, optimising its cost structure. The platform  may  build  warehouses   in  core  markets,  such  as   the  United  States,  to strengthen  its fulfilment  capacity.", "source": "platform/商业生态系统视角下出口型跨境电商企业的海外战略分析_孙智佳.docx", "dimension": "platform", "tags": []},
    {"id": "PLATFORM-商业生态系统视角下出口型跨境电商企业的海-182", "title": "The   SHEIN   platform  is  self-operated,   and   it  relies   heavily   on  th", "content": "The   SHEIN   platform  is  self-operated,   and   it  relies   heavily   on  the   sales profitability method, i.e. the profits and revenues earned from marketing goods on the SHEIN platform.SHEIN has chosen to continue to maintain its advantage of low unit prices and multiple styles, and it even plans to add more styles of apparel. On top of that, SHEIN plans to dramatically change its sales model, for example, according to the SHEIN team, SHEIN plans to harvest 261 million customers in 2025, and 60% of them are repeat customers; in order to not affect SHEIN\'s low-priced audience while incre", "source": "platform/商业生态系统视角下出口型跨境电商企业的海外战略分析_孙智佳.docx", "dimension": "platform", "tags": []},
    {"id": "PLATFORM-商业生态系统视角下出口型跨境电商企业的海-183", "title": "billion in profits by 2025 after effectively reducing warehousing and distributi", "content": "billion in profits by 2025 after effectively reducing warehousing and distribution costs.  Introducing  third-party  sellers   is  a  transformation  that   SHEIN   is  already implementing, launching a third-party marketplace of local sellers in Brazil in 2023, and not long ago opening a third-party marketplace in Mexico and starting to recruit sellers. This initiative will not only help SHEIN expand its customer base, but also ease  the  pressure  of localisation  across borders,  such  as  logistics  and  taxes.  The transition to a third-party platform  for  SHEIN will undoubtedly break  t", "source": "platform/商业生态系统视角下出口型跨境电商企业的海外战略分析_孙智佳.docx", "dimension": "platform", "tags": []},
