    {"id": "PLATFORM-商业生态系统视角下出口型跨境电商企业的海-186", "title": "Poor integration of the  logistics ecosystem has led to high costs for Temu, wit", "content": "Poor integration of the  logistics ecosystem has led to high costs for Temu, with fulfilment  costs  in  the  US  market  accounting  for  nearly  30%  of total  costs. Temu logistics and fulfilment chain consists of three parts,  firstly, the domestic  headway, where sellers can choose to prepare goods in advance  for the VMI mode or JIT mode based on the actual order shipment of goods to domestic warehouses, with freight costs shared equally between Temu and the seller; secondly, the mainline transport by Temu  from  the  domestic  warehouse  through  the  co-operation  of logistics  service", "source": "platform/商业生态系统视角下出口型跨境电商企业的海外战略分析_孙智佳.docx", "dimension": "platform", "tags": []},
    {"id": "PLATFORM-商业生态系统视角下出口型跨境电商企业的海-187", "title": "goods to the hands of the user. In the process of mainline transport, Temu will ", "content": "goods to the hands of the user. In the process of mainline transport, Temu will provide full-link  services  through  logistics   service  providers  such as Jiru  and Yuntou.", "source": "platform/商业生态系统视角下出口型跨境电商企业的海外战略分析_孙智佳.docx", "dimension": "platform", "tags": []},
