    {"id": "PLATFORM-商业生态系统视角下出口型跨境电商企业的海-189", "title": "higher than  the  full  hosting.  Timeliness  is  Temu  \"semi-trusted\"  on  the ", "content": "higher than  the  full  hosting.  Timeliness  is  Temu  \"semi-trusted\"  on  the  important requirements of merchants, in the delivery of time, the seller has a total of \"1 working day delivery\" and \"2 working days delivery\" two options At the same time, within the distribution area,  the platform requires a delivery timeframe of 2-5 working days, calculated  as the range of the merchant\'s  delivery  timeframe  is  about 4-9 days.", "source": "platform/商业生态系统视角下出口型跨境电商企业的海外战略分析_孙智佳.docx", "dimension": "platform", "tags": []},
    {"id": "PLATFORM-商业生态系统视角下出口型跨境电商企业的海-190", "title": "Under the \"fully managed\" model, Temu\'s logistics takes 7-15 days. In addition t", "content": "Under the \"fully managed\" model, Temu\'s logistics takes 7-15 days. In addition to the direct reduction of logistics costs, \"semi-managed\" to improve the efficiency of fulfilment, but also conducive to the increase in the mark-up rate and customer unit price, and thus dilute the logistics costs. The customer unit price of goods under the \"semi-managed  model\"  is  30% or more  higher than that under the  \"fully  managed model\". Under the  latter  model,  the  customer  unit price  of  Temu  is about 40  US dollars, while the customer unit price of \"semi-managed\" can be raised to at least 50 US ", "source": "platform/商业生态系统视角下出口型跨境电商企业的海外战略分析_孙智佳.docx", "dimension": "platform", "tags": []},
